    narr:narration """This hub defines the [core feature of decision capture](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) as the product's primary differentiator, focusing on the preservation of artifacts at the moment of consensus. Following this foundational framing, the narrative shifts to August 2026, where the team reports the successful [deployment of an async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786268099549_1). This functional milestone is linked to the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786268099549_3), which is characterized as the critical unlock for the capture capability. Concurrently, the team highlights [record velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786268099549_2) as a quantitative indicator of recent performance, framing the new tooling and integration as the primary drivers of this output.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786268099549_1> ;
